  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&alpha;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;be on <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>.</p><p>Now, midpoint of AC is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>&alpha;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> which lies on <math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&there4;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&alpha;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&rArr;</mo><mi>&alpha;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&there4;</mo><mi>C</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Similarly, let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&beta;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&beta;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;be on&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math>.</p><p>The midpoint of AB <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>&beta;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&beta;</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;which lies on <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&rArr;</mo><mi>&beta;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&rArr;</mo><mi>B</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/a6de6614-3159-42b6-bbd3-4405f4686f51-image.png\" style=\"width: 230px; height: 185px;\" />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&there4;</mo></math> Area of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&Delta;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>7</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>21</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mn>18</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math>&nbsp;sq. units</p>",
